            46
          ],
          "text": "A `CustomerId` type stops you passing an order id where a customer id belongs."
        },
        {
          "lines": [
            56,
            60
          ],
          "text": "The entity's `equals` and `hashCode` use the id only, so mutation is safe in sets."
        },
        {
